    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i really need to do something quick because i can't even sit in my studio right now without feeling that mental fog. if i wanted to create a sort of localized shielding zone around my desk to prevent these frequencies from reaching me, what kind of materials or setup should i use? i want to make sure nothing gets through.",
